---
description: >-
  Three-lane (Intake, Review, Complete) approval loop: work moves from
  Intake through a Review decision, either finishing in Complete or looping
  back through a "Fix issues" step in Intake, under the default layout.
config:
  logLevel: 0
  flowchart:
    htmlLabels: false
    useMaxWidth: false
---
swimlane-beta LR
  subgraph Intake
  start([Start])
  task[Do work]
  fix[Fix issues]
  end

  subgraph Review
  decision{Ready?}
  end

  subgraph Complete
  done((Done))
  end

  start --> task --> decision
  decision -->|Yes| done
  decision -->|No| fix
  fix --> task
